      "5.1 Build demand signals before investing heavily\nAn audience is broad attention. A waitlist is a more specific expression of interest in a particular future offer.",
      "The principle is:\nBefore building the thing, find people who want the thing.",
      "This can reduce the risk of spending months creating a product that nobody wants.",
